{"channelId":"UCnGyCSPDOud1roNmhCbEdsw","row":["Furkids Animal Rescue and Shelters Cat Shelter",7300,"Furkids, headquartered in Atlanta, GA, is a 501c3 nonprofit charitable organization that operates the largest cage-free, no-kill shelter in the Southeast for rescued cats and Sadie’s Place, a no-kill shelter for dogs. Furkids also operates one of the only facilities in the Southeast dedicated to the care of FIV positive cats. The Furkids mission is to rescue homeless animals, provide them with the best medical care and nurturing environment while working to find them a forever home. Furkids heals the whole animal, physically and emotionally, restoring its health and its spirit.\n\nVisit Furkids.org to learn more!","ickup@furkids.org; info@furkids.org; adopt@furkids.org; cynthia.bueno@furkids.org; dogadoptions@furkids.org; donate@furkids.org; foster@furkids.org; Paige.Smith@furkids.org; Shilohgardens@furkids.org; volunteer@furkids.org; Zac.Hadlock@furkids.org","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnGyCSPDOud1roNmhCbEdsw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnGyCSPDOud1roNmhCbEdsw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:19.203Z","channelId":"UCnGyCSPDOud1roNmhCbEdsw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"6799a9e0986c19cdbc6234b1248468e4f567cd72b325ccd3efdb3829285e1c38","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"fbccdcc24c5dd39c879cb5f44172776fa2ebaafb109e05164677a0abb65636fd"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnGyCSPDOud1roNmhCbEdsw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:01:28.332Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnGyCSPDOud1roNmhCbEdsw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":7300,"raw":"7.3K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnGyCSPDOud1roNmhCbEdsw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:19.203Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"ickup@furkids.org","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":